+# BP-081 — cd_win.c mechanical surface
+
+- Adds the four remaining original `CDAudio_*` names.
+- Maps physical MCI tray/media operations to observable virtual-media state transitions.
+- Preserves notification, loop, failure and validity behavior through 20 fixtures.
